    "--next-step",
    "Restore the original Point2 equality implementation. Independently validate and retain only the exact affine, near-coincident, unknown, abort and concurrent equality regressions plus the conservative-equality documentation on isolated admitted production source. Do not run or claim optimization admission or application speedups."
